{
  "work_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james",
  "source_path": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.0.0",
      "source_sha256": "98e4879e550e7b89",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Order of the Renewal [i.e. of the Presanctified Gifts]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.1.208.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d8180ff42b7f17b6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Order of the Renewal. When the priest performs the Renewal, let them celebrate it, and after the \"Our Father\" let them say the [chant] of the washing of hands,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.1.208.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f79a5f5d81d3c41a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which is said on Sunday: \"Let us bless the Lord at all [times].\" When he has said this, let him add the following:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.1.209.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7d29d6d49b91602a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The hosts of angels, with glory, cry out unceasingly and say: Holy, holy, holy [Lord] of Sabaoth; heaven and earth are full of his [glory]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.1.209.s2",
      "source_sha256": "bcbb892e0a660300",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Let us bless the Lord at all times, always,\" as far as \"He has saved us\"; the same [refrain]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.1.209.s3",
      "source_sha256": "d847febceeacc3cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Hosts of angels, come to the Lord,\" as far as \"who hopes in the Lord\"; \"Hosts of angels.\" And let them add the [chant] of the holy gifts, plagal of the second tone:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.2.210.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6c103546df24ec3a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now the powers of heaven serve invisibly with us, for behold, the King of glory enters."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.2.210.s2",
      "source_sha256": "9a83342df4d89431",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Behold, the mystical sacrifice, offered beforehand, is renewed. With faith and fear let us receive it, so that we may become partakers of eternal life. Alleluia."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.211",
      "source_sha256": "39548f54ba3450ef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when they bring in the holy gifts, let them cover them with the veil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.212",
      "source_sha256": "60c83963db3b9549",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon says: Let us stand well, let us be attentive; let us all pray to the Lord God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.213",
      "source_sha256": "f3f80b1ce34b252b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Kyrie eleison."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.214.s1",
      "source_sha256": "496054461990ae0c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They do not say the Creed. [Prayer:] You who are God and Lord of all, make us worthy at this hour, O lover of mankind, that, cleansed from all guile and duplicity,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.214.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b94037f295088383",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "we may be joined to one another by the holy kiss, united in the knowledge of your Godhead, through our Lord and God and Savior Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.215",
      "source_sha256": "9da7cb4184595e58",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Aloud: For you are [the God] of love and of love for mankind, and to you [we send up] glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.216",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.217",
      "source_sha256": "805ae00d0a3e7e3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest: Peace to all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.218",
      "source_sha256": "335a10a228a037eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: And with your spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.219",
      "source_sha256": "7124af25156795ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon: [Bow] our heads [to the Lord]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.220",
      "source_sha256": "e17506e712aee676",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: To you, O Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.221",
      "source_sha256": "6327e69310bfa51a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There is no kiss [of peace]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.222.s1",
      "source_sha256": "0b98e0fac9716205",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the priest say this prayer quietly: You who alone are Lord and merciful God, [look upon] these who have bowed their necks before your holy altar and ask of you a spiritual gift;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.222.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f8636e64c7b7427b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "send down your blessing and bless them all with spiritual blessing, you who dwell on high and look upon the lowly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.223",
      "source_sha256": "2b7dd37f7f0f19ce",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Aloud: For praised and worshipped and glorified by all is the name [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.3.224",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.225",
      "source_sha256": "dadffb3596aaf6de",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the deacon say the general litany quietly and add this: And for the holy [gifts], prepared beforehand and offered previously, and for the honorable priest who worthily renews them, let us all pray to the Lord God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.226",
      "source_sha256": "aa110c6a8d291dfb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Kyrie eleison. 3 (times)."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.227",
      "source_sha256": "e86d7d08f1f4506e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Glory in the highest, 3 times +. O Lord, open my lips, 3 times +. Our mouth has been filled with praise, 3 times +. To the Father and the Son, 3 (times)."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s1",
      "source_sha256": "14ce2ea449e3dcfd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this first prayer: You who have looked upon us in your mercy, O Lord Almighty, and have granted us boldness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s2",
      "source_sha256": "525ec57eeca2f2f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "your poor and unworthy servants, to stand before your holy altar and to offer to you this rational and bloodless sacrifice for our sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4a22febf3f66a6e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look upon me, your useless servant, and blot out my sins by your compassion, and purify my lips and my heart from every defilement of soul and body, and remove from me every"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s4",
      "source_sha256": "3b22cdcde758812b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "unseemly and senseless thought, and make me able, by the power of your Holy Spirit, for this ministry, and have mercy on me, who have drawn near for your sake before the holy altar, and may it please you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s5",
      "source_sha256": "eaba75639b417fab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O Lord, that this offering which I offer by my [?] may be acceptable, with forgiveness according to my weakness; and do not cast me away from your presence,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a363b896414087a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O Lord, but have mercy on me according to your great mercy, and in the multitude of your compassion put away [?] my iniquities from me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s7",
      "source_sha256": "596210e04661f051",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that, having come without condemnation before your glory, into the shelter [?] of your only-begotten Son, I may not promise freedom to others and grant it to them through your endless love for mankind, while I myself,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s8",
      "source_sha256": "3198a7c863f93052",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as a slave of sin, am found useless. Yes, Master, almighty Lord, hear our supplication, for you are"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.5.228.s9",
      "source_sha256": "926408ae6a14a00b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the one who gives help to all, and we all ask for mercy from you, from the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit, now and always and to the ages of ages. Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.229.s1",
      "source_sha256": "854125e42411c862",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Second prayer: O Lord Almighty, ineffable and unsearchable, incomprehensible, unknowable and invisible,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.229.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1c60aa684a3380bf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O Lord, who alone have immortality and power, and dwell in unapproachable light,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.229.s3",
      "source_sha256": "832ca6675106fcc6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "accept our supplication and petition and the intercession of all your saints, and grant us that this presanctified offering of your name may be accomplished at this hour through the coming of your Holy Spirit,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.229.s4",
      "source_sha256": "6f91544afaf114bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "not for condemnation, nor for judgment, nor for the reproof of our sins,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.229.s5",
      "source_sha256": "66eab690c7b5ba08",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but for healing and salvation, for eternal watchfulness and holiness, and for worthiness and help from you, O Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.230",
      "source_sha256": "586211690a9b0bac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Be exalted [?], Christ; together with you we offer up glory [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.6.231",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.232",
      "source_sha256": "a9876176778675f9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest: Peace to all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.233",
      "source_sha256": "335a10a228a037eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: And with your spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.234.s1",
      "source_sha256": "82f57894304c6db0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacons shall lift up the veil, and one deacon shall say this litany:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.234.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0fd0782ec5388cda",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us complete our supplication to the Lord, for heaven and earth are full of his glory; let us pray to the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.235",
      "source_sha256": "4b5be11d5983e844",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the holy, presanctified, glorious heavenly gift granted to us, let us pray to the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.236",
      "source_sha256": "7ac457286567593c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That the Lord our God may make us worthy to receive his heavenly mystery, let us pray to the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.237",
      "source_sha256": "219bf1d94bd50e68",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That we may be made worthy to partake of the holy and incorruptible heavenly [?] of Christ, let us pray to the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.238",
      "source_sha256": "1c554346b3679c7b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us ask of the Lord unity, faith, and the communion of the all-holy Spirit, and let us commend ourselves and all our life to Christ our God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.7.239",
      "source_sha256": "015b43210c3cca1a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.240.s1",
      "source_sha256": "80d2fbd25fcf0650",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this prayer: O Lord, knower of hearts, who knowest the minds of all men and knowest all things before they come to be,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.240.s2",
      "source_sha256": "10190229e3ad6a81",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "look upon us with thy regard and mercy, and have mercy on us, and accept our supplication and petition, and cleanse our lips and heart from all"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.240.s3",
      "source_sha256": "3eb8830591cf371c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "defilement of soul and body, and make us steadfast, with good acceptance, with boldness and in holiness, before this offering that has been sanctified beforehand."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.241",
      "source_sha256": "5a4eb141693d4ec2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Exclamation: O Lord, [?] with acceptance, as a gift and without condemnation, this presanctified divine mystery, [and grant us] to dare to call upon thee, the holy God of the heavens, the merciful Father, and to say:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.242",
      "source_sha256": "da07f6e22573e65e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Our Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.243.s1",
      "source_sha256": "673a78b1ed88a78c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this prayer: And lead us not into temptation, O Lord, Lord, God of our fathers,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.243.s2",
      "source_sha256": "974b35d1c375e467",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but deliver us from the evil one and from his works, for the sake of thy holy name, which is called upon us in our lowliness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.244",
      "source_sha256": "6278034b95a0a5b3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Exclamation: For thine is the kingdom, the power, and the glory, of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, now and always and [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.8.245",
      "source_sha256": "bd6a3e5edc1214b0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.246",
      "source_sha256": "805ae00d0a3e7e3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest: Peace be to all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.247",
      "source_sha256": "066fd7000892e033",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: And with thy spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.248",
      "source_sha256": "53d11748bee2ab9d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon: Our heads [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.249",
      "source_sha256": "e17506e712aee676",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: To thee, O Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.250.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ae0c579361edaba0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this prayer: To thee thy servants and handmaids have bowed the necks of their hearts, and they ask for the spiritual gift that comes from thee."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.250.s2",
      "source_sha256": "2264860b031910db",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Send down thy blessing, O Lord, and sanctify our souls, our [?], and our bodies,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.250.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2701972017a098a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that we may be made worthy to partake of thine incorruptible heavenly mysteries, for the forgiveness of our sins and as provision for the journey to eternal life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.251",
      "source_sha256": "8aea8cdaf0e1f5a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Exclamation: For blessed, holy, and glorified is thy name, of the Father [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.9.252",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.253",
      "source_sha256": "3e8dcab22422319e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall exclaim: May the grace and mercy of the + holy and consubstantial + and worshipful Trinity be with us all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.254",
      "source_sha256": "5850bd8c54089e7a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: And with thy spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.255",
      "source_sha256": "05e085255ffc404c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon shall say: In the fear of God, attend."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.256.s1",
      "source_sha256": "569870ef42dd79a5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest [shall lift?] the Holy [Gifts] on high and shall say this prayer silently: O ineffable God and Word of the Father, of one essence with the Holy Spirit, sharing with him in origin, in reign, and in existence,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.256.s2",
      "source_sha256": "7cc8bb2b65f06f6c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "accept the hymn we offer over this holy and bloodless sacrifice, together with the unceasing hymn of the Cherubim and Seraphim, [and] mine, thy sinful and unprofitable servant's, crying aloud the word [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.257",
      "source_sha256": "c9add31166d34064",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Aloud: The gift [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.10.258",
      "source_sha256": "a81dadb35ce4aac0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people say: One is holy, one is the Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.11.259",
      "source_sha256": "9171ab3617cebf68",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon shall recite with faith, and the priest shall lift up the holy things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.11.260.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ad1d9dd81084080c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Kyrie eleison. [?] Let him say this: Praise the Lord from the heavens, praise him in the highest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.11.260.s2",
      "source_sha256": "9775a7735fdcd747",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Alleluia. Every spirit, every creature, praise him in the highest. Alleluia."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.11.261.s1",
      "source_sha256": "32e2c978a7391b28",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they shall complete the whole order of communion. [After] communion let him say: We thank you, O Lord, O King,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.11.261.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f13141e12c7a208c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Christ, [for you] have made us [worthy] [?] to receive your incorruptible, first-offered body and precious blood for eternal life. Alleluia."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.262.s1",
      "source_sha256": "d8406c7ea1fece38",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They shall carry the holy things into the diaconicon, and the deacon shall say:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.262.s2",
      "source_sha256": "570b2c94a8f6bcb3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Stand upright, and [let us], who have received the holy and glorious, heavenly, incorruptible life, for whom this holy communion has been made for salvation, for the crushing of our enemy, and for the forgiveness of our sins,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.262.s3",
      "source_sha256": "514a53ea087a0013",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[for] acceptance [?]: the all-holy, blessed, our Lady, the Mother of God, ever-virgin Mary, all the holy, righteous ones and martyrs [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.263.s1",
      "source_sha256": "06fde48c9e388d1b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this prayer: We thank you, O Lord, awesome and good, for you have hidden these things from the wise and the learned and have revealed them to infants."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.263.s2",
      "source_sha256": "82e8dd61eed583e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yes, Father, for so it was well-pleasing before you; for you have made us worthy to receive the body and blood of your only-begotten Son, our Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.263.s3",
      "source_sha256": "b95cceb0463e5757",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We pray and beseech you: let this communion not be to our condemnation, but for the forgiveness of our sins and for eternal life,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.263.s4",
      "source_sha256": "fa95010cd1d8f984",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for you have made us worthy of your holy mysteries, that we may become worthy of your holy delights."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.264",
      "source_sha256": "93d1cbdd2d70a86d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Aloud: Blessed, praised, and glorified be your holy name, of the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit, now and always and"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.12.265",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.266",
      "source_sha256": "805ae00d0a3e7e3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest: Peace to all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.267",
      "source_sha256": "066fd7000892e033",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: And with your spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.268",
      "source_sha256": "c1c349e93e680bdc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon: Let us bow our heads to the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.269",
      "source_sha256": "e17506e712aee676",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: To you, O Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.270.s1",
      "source_sha256": "0381395c1b7b413b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The priest shall say this prayer: O God and Father of our Lord and God and Savior Jesus Christ, who bowed the heavens and came down for the salvation of the human race,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.270.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d6af331cde2cc624",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to you our heads are bowed, and we await the blessing that comes from you. Stretch out your beneficent hand and bless us all with spiritual blessing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.271",
      "source_sha256": "0e52c529c682eb37",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Aloud: For to you is fitting the offering of glory from all, honor and worship, the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit, now and always and unto ages of ages."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.272",
      "source_sha256": "b3e3c4e2605681dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The people: Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.273",
      "source_sha256": "dc951f82d2504c26",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The deacon shall say: Let us sing in the peace of Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.274",
      "source_sha256": "aa8aacf9b2848ba5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "The people shall say: Blessed be the name of the Lord from now on and for ever. (Three times.)"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.275",
      "source_sha256": "5f55cfae601a35fa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "Glory to the Father and to the Son and to the Holy Spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.276",
      "source_sha256": "c5c03cc88ec6ad9f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "The deacon shall say: In the peace of Christ let us [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.13.277",
      "source_sha256": "e7f81ef1b6bcbf9a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "The people shall say: In the name of the Lord, O Lord, bless us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.14.278.s1",
      "source_sha256": "a83b28c1d9e91bc8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "The priest shall read this dismissal prayer for the people: In you all the ends of the earth hope, O Christ, who first commanded with the ten [?] fasting [?] by the law"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.14.278.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b4b2517c74a23308",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "[by] and the prophets and the evangelists: make us worthy to complete those ways, so that we may keep the faith firmly and fulfil your commandment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-liturgy/presanctified-liturgy-of-st-james#LitJacPraes.14.278.s3",
      "source_sha256": "396d4f269af16214",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 8,
      "text": "And on the day of your life-giving resurrection make us worthy of your light, so that we may glorify you, God, and"
    },
    {
